# Full playthrough in the one-button mode (src/one_button.zig): the left
# button only, no keys, title screen to the sportsman ending.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --ms 480000 --one-button --input tools/play/onebutton.input [--dump DIR]
#
# full.input's route, but doors are clicked from wherever the player
# stands (the player walks over first), the keyboard walks are clicks, and
# items are dropped by tap-tap (tap the slot, tap the spot) and by
# dragging, and offered both ways. Deterministic like full.input: the
# random choices (cop, hall doors, quiz) depend on the virtual time, so
# editing an earlier line can change them; this timing gives the good
# cop, the hall shuffle below and the football quiz. Original version (no
# --fix).

# Title menu: JOGAR, then NOVO JOGO; the opening video ends in the bedroom.
22000 click 290 345
+1500 click 370 412
+1000 wait 1fquarbo 200000

